Only a viewing. Nobody showed up.

02:27.690 --> 02:31.319
Nobody? You sure? — just you.

02:31.402 --> 02:35.239
My deepest condolences.
Friend or family?

02:40.703 --> 02:46.000
Would you like me to open it up?
— no. No.

02:47.085 --> 02:48.544
Take your time.

03:22.203 --> 03:23.663
[Whispering] Damn it.

03:38.344 --> 03:40.847
How much further?
— about an hour.

03:42.723 --> 03:45.601
The radio tower.
When was the last time you were there?

03:45.685 --> 03:48.187
The day I recorded the message.

03:49.480 --> 03:53.276
I'll take you to the tower,
but I'm not leaving the island.

03:53.359 --> 03:56.112
What?
— there's no place for me back there.

03:56.195 --> 03:58.489
This is my home now.

04:19.302 --> 04:21.137
Hello, Jack.

04:23.222 --> 04:24.849
