04:56.088 --> 04:58.341
What did Ben say?
— can we kill him?

04:58.424 --> 05:00.593
Is it possible
to turn this equipment off?

05:02.887 --> 05:05.181
The jamming equipment,
can you turn it off?

05:05.264 --> 05:09.018
Sure. Ben gave us the code.
— you are the only ones who have it?

05:09.101 --> 05:10.853
Yeah. Why?

05:10.937 --> 05:14.524
What would happen
if the station were to be flooded?

05:14.607 --> 05:16.984
The casing for the equipment
is waterproof.

05:17.068 --> 05:18.528
It'll keep going forever.

05:18.611 --> 05:21.489
Then why do you need to be here?
— because Ben told us to.

05:21.572 --> 05:24.033
We were following orders.
— you never asked why?

05:24.116 --> 05:28.204
No. Because I trust him.
And I trust Jacob.

05:28.287 --> 05:30.373
The minute I start questioning orders,

05:30.456 --> 05:34.877
this whole thing, everything that
we're doing here falls apart.

05:37.088 --> 05:38.923
She makes an excellent point.

05:50.393 --> 05:51.561
[Girl groans]

06:03.281 --> 06:06.284
I'm sorry, Bonnie.
I, too, am following orders.

06:17.837 --> 06:22.341
No, des. Des! Don't! We need her.

06:46.782 --> 06:49.285
I'm Benjamin.
We haven't had the pleasure.

06:53.581 --> 06:56.208
What do you want?
— just a moment of your time.

06:57.501 --> 07:01.797
To talk. You and me. Alone.
— for what?

07:01.881 --> 07:04.300
Jack, you've just killed
seven of my people.

07:04.383 --> 07:06.886
The least you can give me
is five minutes.

07:12.558 --> 07:15.061
There's only two sets of tracks.
His and hers.

07:44.090 --> 07:47.426
I'm sorry, there are no more
refills left on this prescription.

07:51.597 --> 07:55.601
Well, that's a mistake.
I only refilled it twice.

07:55.685 --> 07:59.146
Could you check again?
— I did check it again, Dr. Shephard.

07:59.230 --> 08:02.316
And that was the third refill,
so there's nothing I can do.

08:03.943 --> 08:06.195
I've got another prescription
right here.

08:06.278 --> 08:10.449
Hey. I know you. You're the hero.

08:10.533 --> 08:13.327
I'm not a hero.
— yeah. We saw it on TV.

08:13.411 --> 08:16.372
Hey, lady, just give this guy
whatever he needs.

08:16.455 --> 08:20.376
Do you know what he did?
— here it is. Here. Oxycodone.

08:20.459 --> 08:22.878
You can't write a prescription
for yourself.

08:22.962 --> 08:25.047
That's Dr. Christian Shephard.

08:25.131 --> 08:27.216
I'm Dr. Jack Shephard.
He's my father.

08:27.299 --> 08:29.927
I'll call his office.
— he's out of town right now.

08:30.010 --> 08:32.304
Well, I'm sure somebody in the office...

08:59.874 --> 09:03.252
Not so long ago, Jack,
I made a decision

09:03.335 --> 09:07.339
that took the lives
of over 40 people in a single day.

09:10.384 --> 09:15.097
I'm telling you this because
history is about to repeat itself.

09:15.181 --> 09:17.725
Right here. Right now.
— let me guess.

09:18.434 --> 09:21.270
You've got us surrounded
and if I don't do what you say,

09:21.353 --> 09:25.900
you're gonna kill all my people.
— no, Jack, you are.

09:29.820 --> 09:33.240
How am I gonna do that, Ben?
— the woman you're traveling with.

09:33.324 --> 09:36.410
The one who parachuted onto the island
from a helicopter.

09:37.369 --> 09:39.622
She's not who she says she is.

09:41.207 --> 09:43.542
She's not? — no. She's not.

09:44.877 --> 09:45.961
/I g, (m I kw)

09:46.045 --> 09:48.130
She's a representative of some people

09:48.214 --> 09:51.258
who have been trying
to find this island, Jack.

09:52.343 --> 09:55.095
She's one of the bad guys.

09:55.179 --> 09:57.640
Oh, I almost forgot.

09:57.723 --> 10:00.768
You're the... you're the good guys.

10:00.851 --> 10:04.146
Jack, listen to me.
If you phone her boat,

10:04.230 --> 10:08.734
every single living person
on this island will be killed.

10:13.072 --> 10:16.492
So here's what has to happen.
Get that device.

10:17.576 --> 10:21.247
The phone she carries with her
and give it to me.

10:21.330 --> 10:24.792
I will turn around
and will go back to my people.

10:24.875 --> 10:27.503
You will turn around
and go back to your people.

10:27.586 --> 10:30.047
I'm not going anwvhere.

10:39.431 --> 10:42.142
May I have my walkie back?
— what?

10:42.226 --> 10:45.229
There's something you need to hear.
Please.

10:55.072 --> 10:56.407
Thank you.

10:57.366 --> 10:58.951
[Walkie—talkie beeps]

10:59.702 --> 11:01.287
Tom? Are you there?

11:03.122 --> 11:05.374
[Tom] Yeah. I'm here.

11:06.041 --> 11:08.002
Your plan killed seven of my people,

11:08.085 --> 11:11.547
but the ones that you failed to kill
are now holding your friends,

11:11.630 --> 11:14.216
Jin, Sayid, Bernard, at gunpoint.

11:14.300 --> 11:16.677
[Sayid] Jack, don't give him any...

11:16.760 --> 11:19.388
[Bernard] Leave him alone!
— [pryce] I said shut up!

11:20.973 --> 11:24.226
And what's to stop me
from snapping your neck?

11:24.310 --> 11:28.022
Tom, unless you hear my voice
in one minute, shoot all three of them.

11:28.105 --> 11:29.231
[ Tom] Got it.

11:29.857 --> 11:31.859
[Pryce] I said don't move.

11:31.942 --> 11:35.487
[Shouting on walkie—talkie]

11:35.571 --> 11:39.366
Bring me the phone, Jack.
— [Sayid] Don't negotiate with him.

11:39.992 --> 11:43.287
[Pryce] Gag them. — [Sayid] No.

11:43.370 --> 11:45.205
Forty seconds. — no.

11:45.289 --> 11:47.875
I'm getting them all off the island.
All of them.

11:47.958 --> 11:50.711
Let me ask you,
why do you want to leave the island?

11:50.794 --> 11:54.173
What is it that you so desperately
want to get back to?

11:54.673 --> 11:56.800
You have no one.
Your father's dead.

11:56.884 --> 11:59.511
Your wife left you,
moved on with another man.

12:00.095 --> 12:04.767
Can you just not wait to get back to
the hospital? Get back to fixing things?

12:04.850 --> 12:09.438
It's 20 seconds now.
Just get me the phone, Jack.

12:09.521 --> 12:12.441
No.
— ten seconds. Bring me the phone.

12:12.524 --> 12:14.735
I'm not bluffing.
— I won't do it!

12:14.818 --> 12:17.112
Five. Four. Three. — no.

12:17.196 --> 12:20.491
[Three gunshots] — [shouting]

12:28.332 --> 12:30.376
I'm so sorry, Jack.

13:01.532 --> 13:04.994
[Breathing heavy] Tom, you there?

13:05.077 --> 13:07.496
Yeah, Jack. I hear you.

13:07.579 --> 13:11.125
I'm going to lead my people
up to the radio tower

13:11.959 --> 13:15.838
and I'm going to make a call.
And I'm going to get them all rescued.

13:15.921 --> 13:17.423
Every one of them.

13:18.590 --> 13:23.262
And then I'm gonna come find you.
And I'm gonna kill you.

13:28.934 --> 13:31.353
[Woman coughing, gasping]

13:35.232 --> 13:36.984
What's the code? — go away.

13:37.067 --> 13:39.361
Let's get this over with.
What's the code?

13:39.445 --> 13:41.822
She's not gonna tell you.
— yeah, she will.

13:41.905 --> 13:43.032
Why do you say that?

13:43.115 --> 13:45.200
It's my destiny to turn off thatjammer.

13:45.284 --> 13:48.245
Ok, Bonnie. We're both
gonna die down here, all right?

13:48.328 --> 13:50.039
Let's be perfectly honest,

13:50.122 --> 13:53.375
one—eyed maniac killed your friend
and shot you in the back.

13:53.459 --> 13:57.296
It would appear that your
glorious leader, Ben, put him up to it.

13:57.796 --> 14:00.299
Are you a sodding idiot?

14:01.133 --> 14:05.387
You have the opportunity
to make Ben very, very angry.

14:05.471 --> 14:07.931
Why would you not take that?

14:13.562 --> 14:15.814
Five, four, five. — what?

14:15.898 --> 14:18.484
Eight, seven, seven...
— is that a code?

14:18.567 --> 14:21.737
Five, five, four, three, seven, six...
— wait. Start again.

14:21.820 --> 14:24.656
Start from the beginning.
Bonnie, from the beginning.

14:24.740 --> 14:27.910
Bonnie, start again. Bonnie.
Bonnie. Wake up. Wake up.

14:27.993 --> 14:30.788
Start again. Start again.
— good vibrations.

14:33.165 --> 14:36.585
Beach boys. Good vibrations.

14:39.338 --> 14:44.426
On the keypad. Numbers, they're notes.

14:48.680 --> 14:51.058
It was programmed by a musician.

15:16.583 --> 15:19.837
Tie him up. He's coming with us.

15:49.825 --> 15:51.201
This is your mother.

16:21.190 --> 16:23.025
Will you help me tie him up?

16:42.586 --> 16:44.254
What happened? What'd he say?

16:44.963 --> 16:47.841
It's not important.
Just get everyone together.

16:47.925 --> 16:50.219
